WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.080
G'day!

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.660
Booking your car in with us is now

3
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.480
super easy with our brand new website.

4
00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.740
Just head to goodyearautocarehobart.com.

5
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:10.620
Quick heads up first.

6
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.780
This website is only for Goodyear

7
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.100
Auto Care Hobart on Brisbane Street.

8
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.480
It's not for any other Goodyear store.

9
00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.800
Okay, here's how it works.

10
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.800
Hit the yellow Book Now button.

11
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.200
Step one, pick what you need.

12
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:27.280
A free tyre inspection, a service, brakes,

13
00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.980
