14
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.440
You'll see an estimate straight away.

15
00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.680
Step two, pop in your car's details

16
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.280
like your rego and the make and model.

17
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.740
Step three, choose a day and a

18
00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.640
drop-off time that suits you.

19
00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.200
Step four, add any extras like

20
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:46.520
pick-up and drop-off or a car wash.

21
00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.580
And step five, your name and

22
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.160
number and how you'd like your

23
00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:53.180
quote by text, email or both.

24
00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:56.080
Tick to agree to the terms and hit send.

25
00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:57.120
That's it.

26
00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.980
Just remember your booking is a request.

27
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.620
We'll text or email you to

28
00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.420
