30
00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.160
Online prices are estimates

31
00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:09.400
and terms and conditions apply.

32
00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:10.660
You can read them all at

33
00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.120
the bottom of our website.

34
00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:13.920
Rather talk to a person?

35
00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:18.020
Give us a call on (03) 6234 3787.

36
00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:19.220
See you soon!

